\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, if at Thy command 
\par The word of life we sow,
\par Watered by Thy almighty hand,
\par The seed shall surely grow:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The virtue of Thy grace
\par A large increase shall give,
\par And multiply the faithful race
\par Who to Thy glory live.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Now then the ceaseless shower
\par Of gosple blessings send,
\par And let the soul-converting power
\par Thy ministers attend.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. On multitudes confer
\par The heart-renewing love,
\par And by the joy of grace prepare
\par For fuller joys above.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

